it is easy to look at the price tag on a jug of adjuvant and wonder whether a lower-cost generic product will do the job just as well as a premium-branded one. After all, if the active ingredients are similar, why pay extra?\nHowever, looking stric...\nMaking the Perfect Pass: Lessons from Our Drone Workshop\nAug 11, 2026\n| Answer Tech\nThe use of drones in row crop agriculture is growing rapidly. It’s estimated that thousands of spray drones entered the U.S. agriculture market last year alone. Yet education on how to use the technology properly and effectively has not kept pace with adoption.\nThat&rsqu...\nMORE NEWS\nMORE WEATHER\nCenDak Cooperative Services\nAGRONOMY\nAGRONOMY\nPRECISION TECH\nUsing today’s technology, we can help you define and manage soil zones, variable rate them with fertilizer and/or seed and get the maximum performance out of your planter.\nPRECISION\nGRAIN\nGRAIN\nEDIBLE BEANS\nBEANS\nENERGY & C-STORES\nENERGY\nFINANCING\nFINANCING\nCareers at CenDak Cooperative\nWe’re always on the lookout for our future crop of agronomy professionals. Check our Careers page to learn about internships and current career opportunities at our many locations in North Dakota.\nCURRENT OPENINGS\n6001 60th Ave NE\nLeeds, ND 58346\nMain: (701) 466-2281\nGrain\nAgronomy\nPrecision Ag\nEdible Beans\nEnergy/c-stores\nFinancing\nAbout\nNews\nWeather\nContact Us\nCareers\nLocations\nWeb App\nConnect with CenDak Cooperative\nDownload Our App\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\nSite Map\nEmployee Portal\n© 2026 CenDak Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
